WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:11.869
Shampoo, Shampoo na-eme ka Ntutu Dị Mma, na Hair Conditioner. Nke a bụ nkebi 3 nke usoro ọmụmụ a.

2
00:00:12.192 --> 00:00:23.271
A na-ere ngwaahịa ntutu site n'otu ha si adị n'aka, ya mere taa anyị ga-eme ha atọ ma nwalee ha n'ezi ntutu.

3
00:00:24.271 --> 00:00:33.305
Ntutu Afro na-akpọkarị nkụ, n'ihi na mmanụ isi anaghị agafe nfe n'ime ntutu gbagọrọ agbagọ.

4
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:41.718
Ya mere shampoo dị na karama ndị a kwesịrị ịsa isi nke ọma, ma ghara ịsachapụ mmanụ niile ruo mgbe ntutu kpọrọ nkụ.

5
00:00:42.104 --> 00:00:55.800
Ma e jiri ya tụnyere hand wash, anyị na-ebuli CAPB site na pasentị 5 ruo pasentị 7 ma tinye panthenol, provitamin B5, iji nyere ntutu aka ijide mmiri.

6
00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:04.898
Ifeoma nke Owerri lere akwụkwọ onye enyemaka ya tupu batch 12 kilogram mbụ ya.

7
00:01:05.268 --> 00:01:16.021
Ahịrị ndị na-abụghị mmiri ruru 3,084 gram, ya mere mmiri ga-abụrịrị 8,916 gram. O kwekọrọ.

8
00:01:16.386 --> 00:01:25.923
Lee panthenol ka ọ na-aga n'elu obere scale. Obere ihe chọrọ scale ziri ezi, ọ bụghị nnukwu scale.

9
00:01:26.923 --> 00:01:33.433
N'ime bọket, gbazee EDTA na mmiri, debe ihe dị ka pasentị 10 maka mmiri nnu.

10
00:01:33.845 --> 00:01:40.321
Gbazee SLES nwayọọ na nkpali dị nro, wee tinye CAPB, glycerin na panthenol.

11
00:01:40.779 --> 00:01:45.416
Buru ụzọ gwakọta isi ụtọ na ntakịrị CAPB ma tinye ya na preservative.

12
00:01:46.416 --> 00:01:57.240
Ugbu a strip. Shampoo kwesịrị ịdị acid ntakịrị, ihe dị ka 5 ruo 6. Dozie ya site n'usoro ihe nlele pasentị 1 nke nkebi 1.

13
00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:11.911
Mee ka ọ gbaa ọkpụrụkpụ na mmiri nnu mgbe nnwale nzọụkwụ gachara, ntakịrị ọkpụrụkpụ karịa hand wash gị. Mgbe ahụ hapụ ya ka ọ zuo ike n'abalị niile ma lelee ya tupu i wụnye ya n'karama.

14
00:02:12.911 --> 00:02:25.112
Ọtụtụ shampoo na-akpa anya. Label gị ga-ekwurịrị: ka ọ ghara imetụ anya, ọ bụrụ na ọ metụrụ, jiri mmiri dị ọcha saa ya nke ọma, dị ka nke a.

15
00:02:25.481 --> 00:02:36.957
Edela na ọ naghị akpa anya, na ọ na-agwọ dandruff, ma ọ bụ na ọ na-eme ka ntutu too, ma ọ bụrụ na ị nweghị nnwale na nkwado NAFDAC, ụlọ ọrụ gọọmentị na-ahụ maka nri na ọgwụ.

16
00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:46.065
Maka 2-in-1, ntakịrị cationic polymer na-ahapụ ihe dị gịrịgịrị n'ntutu mgbe ị saachapụrụ ya.

17
00:02:46.458 --> 00:03:01.233
Ntụ ahụ na-akpụkọ ọnụ ma ọ bụrụ na i wụnye ya otu mgbe. Ya mere Kemi buru ụzọ kpalie guar 30 gram ya n'ime glycerin, wee wụnye slurry ahụ, ya bụ ngwakọta dị ka ofe, n'ime mmiri a na-akpali.

18
00:03:01.671 --> 00:03:09.999
Mgbe minit 30 gachara, ọ dị larịị ma gbaa ọkpụrụkpụ ntakịrị, ọ gara n'ihu n'usoro shampoo nkịtị.

19
00:03:10.999 --> 00:03:22.259
Gosi na ọ na-arụ ọrụ. Saa ụyọkọ ntutu abụọ yiri otu, otu na karama ọ bụla, wee gụọ ugboro ole ị chara ya mgbe ọ ka dị mmiri.

20
00:03:22.623 --> 00:03:34.589
Ọ dịghị mgbe i ga-eme 2-in-1 site n'ịwụnye conditioner ma ọ bụ quat disinfectant n'ime shampoo. Ọ na-agba apịtị ma kewaa.

21
00:03:35.589 --> 00:03:46.064
Ugbu a conditioner, ude anaghị eme ụfụfụ. Tụọ phase A, ya bụ akụkụ mbụ, n'ime ite steel, ma buru ụzọ dee ibu ite efu ahụ.

22
00:03:46.465 --> 00:03:58.155
Phase B, ihe ndị dị ka wax, na-aga n'ite nke abụọ. Mkpụrụ BTMS-50 na-ejikọ mmiri na mmanụ ma na-eme ka ntutu dị mma.

23
00:03:59.155 --> 00:04:07.932
Wax gbazere na 75 digrii na-ere ahụ nke ukwuu ma na-arapara n'akpụkpọ ahụ.

24
00:04:08.305 --> 00:04:20.720
Yiri uwe aka ogologo, akpụkpọ ụkwụ kpuchiri ụkwụ na gloves anaghị ere ọkụ. Tụgharịa aka ite n'ime, ma mee ka ụmụaka nọrọ n'èzí.

25
00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:37.057
A na-ekpo ite abụọ ahụ ọkụ n'ime mmiri ruo ihe dị ka 75 digrii. Debe ha ebe ahụ minit 10 ruo 15 ka wax niile gbazee.

26
00:04:37.467 --> 00:04:46.552
Lee: phase B na-abanye n'ime phase A, ya na stick blender obere oge, minit 2 ruo 3.

27
00:04:46.889 --> 00:04:57.566
Gaa n'ihu na-akpali ka ọ na-ajụ oyi. Hụ ka ọ na-agba ọkpụrụkpụ, ghọọ ude, n'etiti ihe dị ka 50 na 40 digrii.

28
00:04:58.566 --> 00:05:08.297
Naanị n'okpuru 40 digrii ka preservative na isi ụtọ na-abanye. Okpomọkụ na-emebi ha.

29
00:05:09.297 --> 00:05:21.538
Ọ bụrụ na wax na-ekpo ọkụ metụrụ akpụkpọ ahụ, mee ka ebe ahụ jụọ n'okpuru mmiri jụrụ oyi na-asọ ọ dịkarịa ala minit 20, ma gaa ụlọ ọgwụ ma ọ bụrụ na ebe ahụ karịrị obere.

30
00:05:22.538 --> 00:05:37.875
Laghachi na scale. Ite Ngozi tụrụ 1,800 gram mgbe ọ dị efu, ya mere ya na ude 5 kilogram ọ kwesịrị ịgụ 6,800 gram. Ọ gụrụ 6,640 gram.

31
00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:52.899
O kpaliri 160 gram mmiri e siri esi, jụrụ oyi laghachi. Hapụ ya awa 24, lelee na pH dị ihe dị ka 4 ruo 5.5, wee wụnye ya n'ime ite ọnụ sara mbara.

32
00:05:53.899 --> 00:06:05.309
Ugbu a gụọ ihe ọmụmụ ndị dị n'okpuru. Mee shampoo nnwale gị na otu ndị ga-anwale ya, ntụnyere 2-in-1 gị, na conditioner 1 kilogram mbụ gị ya na akwụkwọ okpomọkụ.

